            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 16:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Oyitekwa nyu wikin mut nko odeny kïngeta asisini kewonyö Sapato, otini kopukwa poretayi paghekwa cho kïropchini ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opchinekwa nyu ECHOTYON ropöwo pagh ompö asispa tömönut mut, asis akonga otini kewonyö wïkinö mutï nko odeny cho pö Sapato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opunonekwa kestonikwa makatin odeny cho lïku ropöw cho sis cho kikigha akonga pïsya kilen odeny cho kakïtasta mumar aketö ECHOTYON le ropöwo poretayi pagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oroptonekwa nyu makatin nko wara kechir mut nko odeny cho pö köny akonga cho lïpopöch nko egh akonga nko mökol odeny kïlïkwï amöros nyo kïpelöy ompö ECHOTYON kïmi nko ropöwo pagh nko dipay. Choni kï ropöw cho ngutoy cho onyïn ompö ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay aropta kwagha akonga nyo pö ropöwo ngokï nko mökol odeny cho tïng köny akonga le ropöwo pöghisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kutötö tïsin makatyante nko mökolchay kwodeny le ropöw cho sis cho pö ECHOTYON ompö tïsin. Tïlilöch ropöwechoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okïrurekwa kegh asisoni, ompö tuyot nyo kïkonyïto ECHOTYON, magh ighisyö anka tïkwïl. Nyete kï kirurut nyo pö kokay ompö pïnwöy löwïr ompö wop anka tïkwïl nyo omöngekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
